# Join GNOME Network

## Build your node
1. Follow README wiring instructions
2. Upload Arduino code
3. Test in Serial Monitor
4. See hits logging correctly

## Register
1. Open Issue using Node Registration template
2. GitHub Action assigns your NODE_ID automatically
3. Update NODE_ID in your Arduino code
4. Start contributing data!

## Data quality
- Wrap LED in 6+ layers electrical tape
- Keep away from USB cable during detection
- Let calibrate fully before moving detector
- Run at least 1 hour sessions

